    "title": "<p>Box&nbsp;10.XXX Summary of molecular alterations reported in adenosarcoma {26974998; 25231023; 32351899; 32011345; 36138078; 30266945; 26592504; 36138078; 25231023; 11240741; 28834809}</p>",
